 "text": "-->\nPrairie Ag Partners - Storage Rates\n-->\nStorage Rates\nToggle Navigation\nGrower360 Account Access\nRegister For Grower360\nMobile App\nEmployee Login -->\nEmployee Login\nLogin\nMain Office: 100 Main Ave. S., Lake Preston, SD 57249 Mailing Address: PO Box 158, Lake Preston, SD 57249 Phone Number: 605-847-4844\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Mission\nBoard Members\nJob Opportunities\nLocations\nGrain\nCash Bids\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nCustom Charts\nSpread Charts\nGrain Locations\nStorage Rates\nGrain SDS\nUSDA Reports\nAg News\nAgronomy\nField Plots\nAgronomy Contacts\nCrop Calculator\nFinancing Options\nService Center\nFeed\nEnergy\nPropane\nRefined Fuel\nWeather\nLocal Weather\nWeather Center\nRadar Maps\nNOAA Weather\nMore\nCredit Policy\nElectronic Delivery\nAuto Payment\nDirect Deposit\nContact Us\nNewsletter\nMobile/Email Alerts\nRegister\nLog In\nStorage Rates\nCorn Storage\n2026 Rates:\n.09/cents a month starting on date of delivery, no fee if priced within 14 days of delivery **\nCorn Drying\n$.06/point starting at 15.1% moisture\n1.5% shrink/point over 15%\n$.06 minimum on Corn Drying\nShrunk and dried to 14.0% moisture in the month of December if still on DP\nSoybeans Storage\n2026 Rates:\n.09/cents a month starting on date of delivery, no fee if priced within 14 days of delivery **\nSoybean Shrink\n3% shrink per point over 13\nPrairie Ag reserves the right to stop offering DP at any time.\n** Storage will start day of delivery if not priced after the 14 th day\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation,